#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
"bound {PLAYER}?\p"
"DEWFORD's GYM LEADER BRAWLY commands\n"
"FIGHTING-type POKéMON.\p"
"Going against him with NORMAL-type\n"
"POKéMON is asking for trouble.\p"
"FIGHTING POKéMON will lay a serious\n"
"smack down on NORMAL POKéMON,\l"
"so be careful!\p"
"What's worse, the GYM is as dark as\n"
"the ocean floor.\p"
"But it will get brighter after defeating\n"
"the TRAINERS in your way.\p"
"Hey, okay, go for it!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，你好吗？\n"
"立志成为冠军的{PLAYER}！\p"
"武斗镇的道馆馆主藤树\n"
"使用的是格斗属性的宝可梦。\p"
"用一般属性的宝可梦\n"
"去对付他，那是自找麻烦。\p"
"格斗宝可梦对一般宝可梦\n"
"可是会狠狠痛击的，\l"
"所以要小心哦！\p"
"更糟糕的是，\n"
"这个道馆像海底一样黑。\p"
"不过，打败挡路的训练家以后，\n"
"就会变亮的。\p"
"嘿，好了，加油吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:301
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"Whoah! It's turned too bright in here!\p"
"Your future is bright, too!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！这里变得太亮了！\p"
"你的未来也一片光明哦！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:305
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TakaoIntro"
msgid ""
"Might is right!\n"
"Come on!$"
msgstr ""
"力量就是正义！\n"
"来吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:309
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TakaoDefeat"
msgid "Not enough power…$"
msgstr "力量不够……$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:312
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_TakaoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your skill overcame my strength!\n"
"Your technique is commendable!$"
msgstr ""
"你的技巧胜过了我的力量！\n"
"你的技术值得称赞！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:316
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_JocelynIntro"
msgid ""
"There's no need for BRAWLY to be\n"
"involved!\p"
"I'll crush you!$"
msgstr ""
"根本用不着藤树出手！\p"
"我来打垮你！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:321
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_JocelynDefeat"
msgid ""
"But… How?\n"
"How could I lose so easily?$"
msgstr ""
"可是……怎么会？\n"
"我怎么会这么轻易就输了？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:325
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_JocelynPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm not going to waste this loss.\n"
"I'll use it to motivate me to train!\p"
"One day I'll become a GYM LEADER…\p"
"No, I'll become the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
"CHAMPION!$"
msgstr ""
"我不会白白浪费这次失败的。\n"
"我要把它变成修行的动力！\p"
"总有一天我会成为道馆馆主……\p"
"不，我要成为宝可梦联盟的\n"
"冠军！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:332
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LauraIntro"
msgid ""
"Don't you dare brush me off!\n"
"It's not my fault if you cry!$"
msgstr ""
"你敢小看我试试！\n"
"就算你哭了也不关我的事！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:336
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LauraDefeat"
msgid ""
"Waaaaaaah!\n"
"I lost!$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊啊啊啊！\n"
"我输了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LauraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I battle in the dark to make my heart\n"
"stronger.\p"
"But because it's so dark, I can never\n"
"see BRAWLY's face…$"
msgstr ""
"我在黑暗中对战，\n"
"是为了让自己的内心变得更坚强。\p"
"可是因为太黑了，\n"
"我从来都看不清藤树的脸……$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LilithIntro"
msgid ""
"Ufufu…\n"
"Are you stumbling around in the dark?$"
msgstr ""
"呜呼呼……\n"
"你是不是在黑暗中迷路了？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:350
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LilithDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, you…\n"
"I don't want to know you!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你……\n"
"我才不想认识你呢！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_LilithPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You deserve to stay lost and end up\n"
"back at the entrance again!$"
msgstr ""
"你就继续迷路，\n"
"然后又回到入口去吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrendenIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll show you the gumption of\n"
"a sailing man!$"
msgstr ""
"让你见识一下\n"
"海上男儿的胆量！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:362
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrendenDefeat"
msgid ""
"How'd this happen?\n"
"It's not like me to lose this way!$"
msgstr ""
"怎么会这样？\n"
"我才不会这样输掉呢！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrendenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, aye! You're worthy of seeing\n"
"our GYM LEADER.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，没错！你有资格\n"
"去见我们的道馆馆主。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:370
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_CristianIntro"
msgid ""
"If you mean to pass, it has to be\n"
"through me!$"
msgstr ""
"想要过去的话，\n"
"就得先打败我！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:374
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_CristianDefeat"
msgid ""
"Grrrrr!\n"
"Vastly overpowered!$"
msgstr ""
"呜呜呜！\n"
"实力差太多了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:378
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_CristianPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You win!\n"
"Go after that BADGE!$"
msgstr ""
"你赢了！\n"
"去拿徽章吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm BRAWLY!\n"
"DEWFORD's GYM LEADER!\p"
"I've been churned in the rough waves\n"
"of these parts, and I've grown tough\l"
"in the pitch-black cave!\p"
"So you wanted to challenge me?\n"
"Let me see what you're made of!$"
msgstr ""
"我是藤树！\n"
"武斗镇的道馆馆主！\p"
"我在这一带的惊涛骇浪中历练，\n"
"在漆黑的洞窟里\l"
"变得坚强！\p"
"你想挑战我吗？\n"
"让我看看你有几斤几两吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:391
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Whoah, wow! You made a much bigger\n"
"splash than I expected!\p"
"You swamped me!\p"
"Okay, you've got me.\n"
"Take this GYM BADGE!$"
msgstr ""
"哇，哇！你掀起的浪花\n"
"比我想象的还要大！\p"
"我被你吞没了！\p"
"好吧，我认输。\n"
"收下这枚道馆徽章吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_ReceivedKnuckleBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the KNUCKLE BADGE\n"
"from BRAWLY.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}从藤树那里\n"
"得到了拳头徽章。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_KnuckleBadgeInfoTakeThis"
msgid ""
"The KNUCKLE BADGE makes all POKéMON\n"
"up to Level 30, even those you get in\l"
"trades, obey without question.\p"
"And, you'll be able to use the HM move\n"
"FLASH outside of battle.\p"
"If you'd like, use this TECHNICAL\n"
"MACHINE, too.$"
msgstr ""
"有了拳头徽章，等级30以下的\n"
"所有宝可梦，包括交换得来的，\l"
"都会乖乖听你的话。\p"
"而且，你还能在对战以外\n"
"使用秘传招式闪光。\p"
"如果你愿意的话，\n"
"这个招式学习器也拿去用吧。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:411
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_ExplainBulkUp"
msgid ""
"That TM08 contains BULK UP.\p"
"It's a move that raises both ATTACK\n"
"and DEFENSE stats.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"这个招式学习器08里是健美。\p"
"这个招式能同时提高\n"
"攻击和防御。\p"
"…… …… ……$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_RegisteredBrawly"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADER BRAWLY\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""
"在宝可导航中\n"
"登记了道馆馆主藤树。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I can see your talent becoming a giant\n"
"wave to cause a storm of astonishment\l"
"among TRAINERS one day!$"
msgstr ""
"我能看到，你的才能总有一天\n"
"会化作巨浪，在训练家之间\l"
"掀起一场惊叹的风暴！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:426
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "DEWFORD TOWN POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr "武斗镇宝可梦道馆$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:429
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"DEWFORD TOWN POKéMON GYM\p"
"BRAWLY'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""
"武斗镇宝可梦道馆\p"
"藤树认可的训练家：\n"
"{PLAYER}$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:434
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPreRematch"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: A wave may draw back, but it\n"
"always returns to the shore.\p"
"A giant wave of a talent like you…\n"
"I knew you would return!\p"
"Show me how much higher\n"
"you've gone!$"
msgstr ""
"藤树：海浪虽然会退去，\n"
"但一定会再回到岸边。\p"
"像你这样才能如巨浪般的人……\n"
"我就知道你一定会回来！\p"
"让我看看你变得\n"
"有多强了吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:442
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"Swamped again!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"又被吞没了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:446
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: Battling is vast and it's deep.\n"
"You can't see the bottom.\l"
"It's just like the sea of HOENN!$"
msgstr ""
"藤树：对战既广阔又深奥。\n"
"深不见底。\l"
"就像丰缘的大海一样！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc:451
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"BRAWLY: A wave may draw back, but it\n"
"always returns to the shore.\p"
"A giant wave of a talent like you…\n"
"I knew you would return!\p"
"Oh? You only have one POKéMON\n"
"that can battle.\p"
"I'm sorry, but I'd like you to come back\n"
"with at least two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"藤树：海浪虽然会退去，\n"
"但一定会再回到岸边。\p"
"像你这样才能如巨浪般的人……\n"
"我就知道你一定会回来！\p"
"哦？你能战斗的宝可梦\n"
"只有1只啊。\p"
"抱歉，请你至少带上\n"
"2只宝可梦再来吧。$"
